  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "心內話 - 阿母縛肉粽"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《阿母縛肉粽》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/張芬瑛</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjgVA23lnoyXLMAvYuRJwhSZK03GTJpeWzUzPv1LRT_w3oseJE1WQzjPL7vzcflEmueyeYrDUH9MRD7GjaTb7K4MNJEYrDhckcgsFLwsQp1z7gjXUiw0XQw1gW_gKqt-YE7VqaGhfS3VMq8fLyOJdJwfqHhOIFurTKrSzG1F_zBkSZ7Zo_W_LX8_p44Wx7V\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjgVA23lnoyXLMAvYuRJwhSZK03GTJpeWzUzPv1LRT_w3oseJE1WQzjPL7vzcflEmueyeYrDUH9MRD7GjaTb7K4MNJEYrDhckcgsFLwsQp1z7gjXUiw0XQw1gW_gKqt-YE7VqaGhfS3VMq8fLyOJdJwfqHhOIFurTKrSzG1F_zBkSZ7Zo_W_LX8_p44Wx7V=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">便若聽著有人leh siàu念in阿母縛ê肉粽，講有偌nī好食--leh，阮就想起阿母hit擺縛肉粽ê畫面。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tī我小學三年hit冬ê五日節進前，阿母雄雄講beh縛肉粽，自細漢阮就m̄ bat看過阿母縛肉粽。因為阿母以早家境bē-bái，伊kan-na負責讀冊就好，家內事lóng有使用人leh tàu-sann-kāng，一寡傳統ê煮食親像縛肉粽、炊粿、做糕仔餅仔iah是煙腸臘肉……阮阿母lóng bē-hiáu。所以聽著伊beh縛肉粽，阮囡仔人lóng歡喜kah，mā tsiok期待--ê。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">一个拜六下晡阮下課tńg--來，看著阿母tshuân kah規桌頂ê料，有tsu̍t米、肉、香菇kah鹹鴨卵仁，粽ha̍h仔mā洗好一大疊。阮就趕緊洗手做伙來縛粽。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">頭先ài kā粽ha̍h仔ut一个親像漏仔ê形，tsiah-koh kā米kah料囥落去內底，tsinn hōo飽tīnn，suà--落-來ài kā tēnn hōo ân，tsiah ē-sái用棉索仔kā縛做一个立體ê三角形，tsit步是上困難--ê。 阮逐家縛kah大粒汗細粒汗，舞kah phēnn-phēnn喘，一直創lóng bē好勢，規kuānn粽縛kah歪ko-tshi̍h-tshua̍h，有夠歹看--ê--lah。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Suà--落-來阿母就kā粽提去sa̍h，一陣iau鬼囡仔等lóng bē tiâu，一直問「好--ah--未？好--ah--未？」。等點外鐘久，有鼻著芳味，阿母講應該ē-sái--ah，逐家lóng緊倚--過-來，目睭金金siòng，喙瀾kiōng-beh滴--落-來--ah。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">鼎一下掀--開逐家suah tsua̋nn gāng--去，肉粽--leh？肉粽走去佗位？Kan-na看著一鼎散phún-phún ê米糕糜，一堆粽ha̍h仔tī hia浮浮沉沉，連一粒肉粽mā無看著影，tsit聲hōo阮suah笑bē出--來mā哭bē出--來。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">自hit改失敗了後阿母m̄ bat koh縛過肉粽，所以tse mā是我tsit世人唯一一擺阿母縛肉粽ê記持。Mā因為án-ne，致使到tann我猶原學bē-hiáu縛粽，一直感覺縛肉粽是全世界上困難ê代誌！</span></div><div><br /></div><div><h2><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 378